{"seq":2,"slug":"health-data-standards","title":"研究生 生物医学信息学 — 卫生数据标准","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/biomedical-informatics/health-data/health-data-standards","wordCount":1697,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-生物医学信息学-卫生数据标准\">研究生 生物医学信息学 — 卫生数据标准</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>卫生数据标准（Health Data Standards）是实现医疗信息系统互操作性和数据语义一致性的基础规范体系，涵盖术语标准（概念的统一命名）、消息标准（数据交换格式）、文档标准（临床文档结构）和安全标准（隐私与访问控制）。在全球卫生信息化深入推进的背景下，标准化是解决&quot;数据孤岛&quot;问题的根本途径——没有共同标准，不同医疗机构、区域和国家之间的健康数据无法有效流通和利用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"术语标准体系\">术语标准体系</h3><p>术语标准为临床概念提供统一的编码和定义，是语义互操作性的核心：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语标准</th>\n<th>维护机构</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n<th>主要用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ICD-10/ICD-11</td>\n<td>WHO</td>\n<td>疾病分类</td>\n<td>疾病编码、死因统计、医保支付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SNOMED CT</td>\n<td>SNOMED International</td>\n<td>临床概念（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>350</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 350,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">350</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span> 个）</td>\n<td>临床记录的语义编码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LOINC</td>\n<td>Regenstrief Institute</td>\n<td>检验/检查项目</td>\n<td>实验室结果和临床观测标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RxNorm</td>\n<td>NLM (US)</td>\n<td>药物</td>\n<td>药物名称标准化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPT/HCPCS</td>\n<td>AMA/CMS</td>\n<td>医疗操作</td>\n<td>手术/操作编码、费用计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ATC</td>\n<td>WHO</td>\n<td>药物分类</td>\n<td>药物利用研究</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>SNOMED CT</strong> 是目前最全面的临床术语体系，采用描述逻辑（Description Logic）形式化定义概念间的关系：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;肺炎 (233604007)&quot;] --&gt;|IS-A| B[&quot;下呼吸道感染&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|Finding Site| C[&quot;肺结构&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|Causative Agent| D[&quot;微生物&quot;]&#10;    &#10;    E[&quot;社区获得性肺炎&quot;] --&gt;|IS-A| A&#10;    F[&quot;医院获得性肺炎&quot;] --&gt;|IS-A| A&#10;    &#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;细菌&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;病毒&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; I[&quot;真菌&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"肺炎 (233604007)\"] --&gt;|IS-A| B[\"下呼吸道感染\"]\n    A --&gt;|Finding Site| C[\"肺结构\"]\n    A --&gt;|Causative Agent| D[\"微生物\"]\n    \n    E[\"社区获得性肺炎\"] --&gt;|IS-A| A\n    F[\"医院获得性肺炎\"] --&gt;|IS-A| A\n    \n    D --&gt; G[\"细菌\"]\n    D --&gt; H[\"病毒\"]\n    D --&gt; I[\"真菌\"]</pre><p>SNOMED CT 的<strong>后组配</strong>（Post-coordination）机制允许在概念层面组合表达更精确的临床含义：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>右膝骨关节炎</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>396275006</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>363698007</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>72696002</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>K</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{右膝骨关节炎} = 396275006|OA| : 363698007|Finding\\,Site| = 72696002|Right\\,Knee|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">右膝骨关节炎</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">396275006∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">363698007∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72696002∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ee</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>LOINC</strong>（Logical Observation Identifiers Names and Codes）为每个实验室检查/临床观测分配唯一标识码，其命名遵循 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 轴结构：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LOINC Code</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>组分</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>属性</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>时间</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>系统</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>标度</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>方法</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LOINC Code} = f(\\text{组分}, \\text{属性}, \\text{时间}, \\text{系统}, \\text{标度}, \\text{方法})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LOINC Code</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">组分</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">属性</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时间</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">系统</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">标度</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">方法</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如：LOINC <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2345</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2345</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2345</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> = 葡萄糖(组分):质量浓度(属性):时点(时间):血清/血浆(系统):定量(标度)</p>\n<h3 id=\"消息与交换标准\">消息与交换标准</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标准</th>\n<th>版本</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HL7 v2.x</td>\n<td>1987-</td>\n<td>管道分隔文本格式，简单灵活</td>\n<td>院内系统集成（ADT、ORM、ORU）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HL7 v3/CDA</td>\n<td>2005-</td>\n<td>XML 结构化文档，RIM 模型</td>\n<td>区域健康信息交换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HL7 FHIR</td>\n<td>2014-</td>\n<td>RESTful API，JSON/XML 资源</td>\n<td>现代互操作性，第三方应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DICOM</td>\n<td>1993-</td>\n<td>医学影像通信</td>\n<td>影像存储与传输（PACS）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IHE Profiles</td>\n<td>2000-</td>\n<td>集成规范（整合多种标准）</td>\n<td>跨系统工作流实现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>HL7 v2</strong> 仍是全球 EHR 系统间消息交换的主力标准（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span> 的美国医院使用），消息格式示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"MSH|^~\\&amp;|LAB|HOSPITAL|EHR|HOSPITAL|202501151030||ORU^R01|MSG00001|P|2.5.1&#10;PID|||P001||Zhang^Wei||19800315|M&#10;OBR|1||LAB123|2345-7^Glucose^LOINC&#10;OBX|1|NM|2345-7^Glucose^LOINC||7.2|mmol/L|3.9-6.1|H\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>MSH|^~\\&#x26;|LAB|HOSPITAL|EHR|HOSPITAL|202501151030||ORU^R01|MSG00001|P|2.5.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PID|||P001||Zhang^Wei||19800315|M</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>OBR|1||LAB123|2345-7^Glucose^LOINC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>OBX|1|NM|2345-7^Glucose^LOINC||7.2|mmol/L|3.9-6.1|H</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>FHIR</strong> 的资源（Resource）模型相比 HL7 v2 和 v3 具有显著优势：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>HL7 v2</th>\n<th>HL7 v3/CDA</th>\n<th>FHIR</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据格式</td>\n<td>管道分隔文本</td>\n<td>XML</td>\n<td>JSON/XML</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 模式</td>\n<td>消息</td>\n<td>文档</td>\n<td>RESTful</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可扩展性</td>\n<td>有限（Z段）</td>\n<td>灵活但复杂</td>\n<td>扩展（Extension）机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移动/Web 友好</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社区生态</td>\n<td>成熟</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>快速增长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"临床文档标准\">临床文档标准</h3><p><strong>CDA</strong>（Clinical Document Architecture）是 HL7 v3 的临床文档标准，将文档组织为 Header（元数据）和 Body（临床内容），支持三个成熟度级别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Level 1：非结构化（如 PDF 嵌入）</li>\n<li>Level 2：节（Section）级结构化</li>\n<li>Level 3：完全结构化（条目级编码）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>C-CDA</strong>（Consolidated CDA）是美国 Meaningful Use 要求的标准文档格式，定义了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span> 种标准文档类型（如出院小结、门诊小结、转诊通知等）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"安全与隐私标准\">安全与隐私标准</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标准/法规</th>\n<th>地区</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HIPAA</td>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>保护健康信息（PHI）的隐私与安全规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GDPR</td>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>通用数据保护条例（健康数据为特殊类别）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个人信息保护法</td>\n<td>中国</td>\n<td>个人信息处理规则、敏感信息保护</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>去标识化</strong>（De-identification）是健康数据用于研究前的必要步骤。HIPAA 定义了两种方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>专家判定法</strong>（Expert Determination）：由统计专家评估重识别风险低于预设阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>re-identification</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{re-identification}) &lt; \\frac{1}{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">re-identification</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>安全港法</strong>（Safe Harbor）：移除 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span></span></span></span></span> 类标识符（姓名、日期、地址、身份证号等）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"术语映射与跨标准整合\">术语映射与跨标准整合</h3><p>临床实践中，不同标准在不同场景下互补使用，需要进行术语映射：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ICD-10</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">↔</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>映射</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>SNOMED CT</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">↔</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>映射</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>本地编码</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ICD-10} \\xleftrightarrow{\\text{映射}} \\text{SNOMED CT} \\xleftrightarrow{\\text{映射}} \\text{本地编码}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ICD-10</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">映射</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.75em;\"><span class=\"halfarrow-left\" style=\"height:0.522em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M400000 241H110l3-3c68.7-52.7 113.7-120\n 135-202 4-14.7 6-23 6-25 0-7.3-7-11-21-11-8 0-13.2.8-15.5 2.5-2.3 1.7-4.2 5.8\n-5.5 12.5-1.3 4.7-2.7 10.3-4 17-12 48.7-34.8 92-68.5 130S65.3 228.3 18 247\nc-10 4-16 7.7-18 11 0 8.7 6 14.3 18 17 47.3 18.7 87.8 47 121.5 85S196 441.3 208\n 490c.7 2 1.3 5 2 9s1.2 6.7 1.5 8c.3 1.3 1 3.3 2 6s2.2 4.5 3.5 5.5c1.3 1 3.3\n 1.8 6 2.5s6 1 10 1c14 0 21-3.7 21-11 0-2-2-10.3-6-25-20-79.3-65-146.7-135-202\n l-3-3h399890zM100 241v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"halfarrow-right\" style=\"height:0.522em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SNOMED CT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">映射</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.75em;\"><span class=\"halfarrow-left\" style=\"height:0.522em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M400000 241H110l3-3c68.7-52.7 113.7-120\n 135-202 4-14.7 6-23 6-25 0-7.3-7-11-21-11-8 0-13.2.8-15.5 2.5-2.3 1.7-4.2 5.8\n-5.5 12.5-1.3 4.7-2.7 10.3-4 17-12 48.7-34.8 92-68.5 130S65.3 228.3 18 247\nc-10 4-16 7.7-18 11 0 8.7 6 14.3 18 17 47.3 18.7 87.8 47 121.5 85S196 441.3 208\n 490c.7 2 1.3 5 2 9s1.2 6.7 1.5 8c.3 1.3 1 3.3 2 6s2.2 4.5 3.5 5.5c1.3 1 3.3\n 1.8 6 2.5s6 1 10 1c14 0 21-3.7 21-11 0-2-2-10.3-6-25-20-79.3-65-146.7-135-202\n l-3-3h399890zM100 241v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"halfarrow-right\" style=\"height:0.522em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">本地编码</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>UMLS（Unified Medical Language System）由 NLM 维护，整合了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 个源词表的概念，通过 CUI（Concept Unique Identifier）建立跨术语的概念关联。例如：&quot;心肌梗死&quot;在不同术语中的表示：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>编码</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ICD-10-CM</td>\n<td>I21.9</td>\n<td>Acute myocardial infarction, unspecified</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SNOMED CT</td>\n<td>22298006</td>\n<td>Myocardial infarction</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MeSH</td>\n<td>D009203</td>\n<td>Myocardial Infarction</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UMLS CUI</td>\n<td>C0027051</td>\n<td>(统一标识)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某医院正在将传统 HL7 v2 接口升级为 FHIR。请为以下场景设计 FHIR 资源交互方案：(a) 实验室系统向 EHR 发送血常规结果，(b) EHR 向区域健康信息平台推送出院小结，(c) 移动端患者应用查询个人药物列表。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较 ICD-11 与 SNOMED CT 在表达临床概念方面的差异。为什么国际上倡导&quot;ICD 用于统计分类，SNOMED CT 用于临床记录&quot;的双轨策略？在什么情况下两者的边界会模糊？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>HIPAA 安全港法要求移除 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span></span></span></span></span> 类标识符以实现去标识化。但研究表明，即使移除所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span></span></span></span></span> 类标识符，通过组合准标识符（如诊断、就诊日期、年龄段）仍可能重识别约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.04</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.04\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.04%</span></span></span></span></span> 的个体。请讨论安全港法的局限性，以及差分隐私（Differential Privacy）作为补充保护措施的原理。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>你需要将一个使用本院自定义编码的实验室信息系统映射到 LOINC 标准。共有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>800</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">800</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">800</span></span></span></span></span> 个本地检验项目。请设计一个系统化的映射流程，包括自动匹配、人工审核和质量验证步骤。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Benson, T. &amp; Grieve, G. (2021)</strong>：《Principles of Health Interoperability: FHIR, HL7 and SNOMED CT》第 4 版——卫生信息互操作性标准的综合教科书</li>\n<li><strong>McDonald, C.J. et al. (2003)</strong>：&quot;LOINC, a Universal Standard for Identifying Laboratory Observations&quot;，Clinical Chemistry——LOINC 标准的权威介绍</li>\n<li><strong>SNOMED International (2024)</strong>：SNOMED CT Starter Guide——SNOMED CT 入门指南</li>\n<li><strong>Bodenreider, O. (2004)</strong>：&quot;The Unified Medical Language System (UMLS)&quot;，Nucleic Acids Research——UMLS 系统的综合描述</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>卫生数据标准是医疗信息化从&quot;数据孤岛&quot;走向&quot;数据流通&quot;的基础。术语标准（SNOMED CT、LOINC、ICD）解决&quot;说同一种语言&quot;的问题，消息标准（HL7 FHIR）解决&quot;如何对话&quot;的问题，安全标准（HIPAA、GDPR）解决&quot;如何保护&quot;的问题。UMLS 作为术语映射的枢纽，弥合了不同标准体系间的语义鸿沟。随着 FHIR 的全球普及和各国卫生信息化政策的推进，标准化正在从技术理想走向临床现实。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 生物医学信息学 — 卫生数据标准","id":"研究生-生物医学信息学-卫生数据标准"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"术语标准体系","id":"术语标准体系"},{"level":3,"text":"消息与交换标准","id":"消息与交换标准"},{"level":3,"text":"临床文档标准","id":"临床文档标准"},{"level":3,"text":"安全与隐私标准","id":"安全与隐私标准"},{"level":3,"text":"术语映射与跨标准整合","id":"术语映射与跨标准整合"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 生物医学信息学 — 电子健康档案","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/biomedical-informatics/health-data/electronic-health-records"},"next":{"title":"研究生 生物医学信息学 — 健康数据治理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/biomedical-informatics/health-data/data-governance-health"}}